              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa Elija yamala komoloma, Ahabu yatandula zinguvu zizie, niyinavuula kandi niyiviika zinguvu zia magunia. Yasura kulia, naagona mu zinguvu zia magumia, nokogendagenda novovereri kandi mwoyo ni guukuzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.27"
            ]
          }
        }
