          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ukaloli kuli Ahabu yegehizi umwene imbiri wange? Kigira umali kokora yaga, sindaleeta kivi kuye mu ing'inga yi livamwoyo lilie mba; galakave mu ing'inga yi livamwoyo liu muyaayi weve lwa ndileeta kivi ku vinyumba ya Ahabu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.29"
            ]
          }
        }
